/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store

# The site's generated files: built by site/build.sh from the sources above.
# `app.*` and `api.*` are `kitec build site/src/main.kite` — the site's own
# program, whose source is `site/src/` and is not generated.
site/app.wasm
site/app.js
site/api.js
site/api.d.ts
site/kite_playground.wasm
# The finished pages: rendered by `site/src/build.kite` from the documents.
site/read/
site/reference/
site/install.html
site/docs/
site/SPECIFICATION.md
site/README.md
site/install.sh
site/demo/

# The rendered package manifests: written by packaging/render.sh from a
# release's own checksums. The ones in the tree keep their placeholders so they
# stay reviewable; these are release artefacts.
packaging/out/

# Wrangler's local state, not the site.
.wrangler/

# Built by `kitec build` into the example page's own directory, because that is
# where a page needs them. The page, the stylesheet and the program are source;
# these four are output — including the two `api.*`, which the same one command
# writes and which were tracked while their siblings were not.
examples/page/app.js
examples/page/app.wasm
examples/page/api.js
examples/page/api.d.ts

# The starter's own build output and dependencies.
examples/vite-starter/dist/
examples/vite-starter/node_modules/
examples/vite-starter/package-lock.json
